{
  "$comment": "Device login vectors (README \"Device login\"). `user_codes`: what a person types on the verification page, the stored form (`code`, RFC 8628 base-20 letters without the dash) or `valid: false`. `tokens`: the access token of a device grant (both grants of POST /v1/identity/device/token): `client` is the registered client id, `account` the person who confirmed, `ceiling` the scope of the login (POST /v1/identity/device/code `scope`; null = none), `request` the extension fields audience / scope / expires_in, `now` the issuer's clock; `claims` = the issued claims except jti, or `error` = the OAuth error code. Signing, storage and rotation are not part of these vectors.",
